  "content": {
    "id": "p15-q8-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "A function is given by $f(x)=\\frac{x^2}{72}$. Over what domain starting at $x=0$ is this a PDF?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$[0,6]$",
      "worked": "Let the domain be $[0,b]$, where $b>0$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\int_0^b\\frac{x^2}{72}\\,dx&=1\\\\\\left[\\frac{x^3}{216}\\right]_0^b&=1\\\\\\frac{b^3}{216}&=1\\\\b^3&=216\\\\b&=6\\end{align*}$$\n\nSince $f(x)\\ge0$ on $[0,6]$, the required domain is $[0,6]$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
